{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"USN-8788-1","published":"2026-09-21T12:05:10Z","modified":"2026-09-21T21:42:45.295245362Z","related":["UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20337","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20338","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20339","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20345","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20346","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20347","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20348"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-20337","CVE-2026-20338","CVE-2026-20339","CVE-2026-20345","CVE-2026-20346","CVE-2026-20347","CVE-2026-20348","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20337","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20338","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20339","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20345","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20346","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20347","UBUNTU-CVE-2026-20348"],"summary":"clamav vulnerabilities","details":"It was discovered that ClamAV incorrectly handled certain zip archive\nfiles. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause ClamAV\nto crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-20337,\nCVE-2026-20338)\n\nIt was discovered that ClamAV incorrectly handled certain PESpin files.\nA remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause ClamAV to\ncrash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-20339)\n\nIt was discovered that ClamAV incorrectly handled certain GPT files. A\nremote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause ClamAV to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-20345)\n\nIt was discovered that ClamAV incorrectly handled certain PDF files. A\nremote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause ClamAV to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-20346)\n\nIt was discovered that ClamAV incorrectly handled certain Mach-O files.\nA remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause ClamAV to\ncrash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-20347)\n\nIt was discovered that ClamAV incorrectly handled certain XAR files. A\nremote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause ClamAV to crash,\nresulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-20348)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"clamav","ecosystem":"Ubuntu:22.04:LTS","purl":"pkg:deb/ubuntu/clamav?arch=source&distro=jammy"},